  "description": "🚀 Release Notes – RapidFireUI 8.0.10.0\n\nWe’re excited to announce RapidFireUI 8.0.10.0, an enhancement update focused on improving the flexibility and user experience of the TabRF component.\n\nThis release introduces optional new features to give you more control over tab navigation and actions.\n\n✨ Enhancements to TabRF\n\n1️⃣ Custom Footer Actions (New)\n\nYou can now define custom action buttons inside tabs using the new <Actions> section.\n\n* Fully customizable buttons\n* Access current tab index\n* Ideal for Save, Cancel, and custom workflow actions\n\n2️⃣ Progress Bar on Tab Change (New)\n\nA sleek progress bar can now be displayed when switching tabs.\n\n* ProgressThickness → Controls thickness (e.g., \"2px\")\n* ProgressColor → Controls progress bar color\n* Works seamlessly with Stepper mode\n* Fully optional\n\n🆕 New Parameters\n\nProgressThickness – Sets the progress bar thickness\nProgressColor – Sets the progress bar color\nActionPosition – Controls alignment of footer actions",
  "iconFile": "rf.png",
